{
  "about": [
    "Every attack comes from a direction. Every guard faces one. Meet a slash with the right guard just before it lands and you redirect it: its momentum turns against the attacker.",
    "Six opponents, each built from the same move cards and the same rules. The last ones read you: they track what you lean on and answer it, and they tell you what they think you do.",
    "Every number in the game is a card. The equilibria the AIs play are computed exactly by the card model, and the whole game is card-language logic compiled to native code."
  ],
